  "ingredients": [
    "4 large onions",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "4 cubes chicken bouillon"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat and lightly oil the grate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/g5FsGEVJ0PguigJZEyZdt4syMmU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14564-grilled-onions-VAT-001-Step-01-760dfd2a7a1c4fc1947196ffa4e53776.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14564/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel outer layer off onions. Slice a small section off of one end of each onion, and make a small hole in the center. Fill the center of each onion with a bouillon cube and 2 tablespoons butter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BDYnui1taDDzsgpSrNg79U-3o08=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14564-grilled-onions-VAT-002-Step-02-a9b2cdb5436b43d9a057233dffdee6f0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14564/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Replace the top of the onion, and wrap in aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/n-Xmdh97_52H-fKyDmt9ESD7h1g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14564-grilled-onions-VAT-003-Step-03-77b5a43067ca4cf586469e3833626a61.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14564/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place onions on preheated grill over indirect heat, and close the lid. Cook until tender, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/coyolSEF-iPuyLbTFh_ooSH5tT0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14564-grilled-onions-VAT-004-Step-04-a961b6904f4743c29566571ac2ff7d2c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14564/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the tops, and cut into bite size chunks. Place in a serving dish with all the juices from the foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cq8abGICif9nAEnQSChPRKNNTyc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14564-grilled-onions-VAT-005-Step-05-158a5c61818449cc8a80792d91150eb4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14564/step_05.webp"
    }
